    "Sent reports are public. They include app and system versions, general recording settings, recent event types, and an optional crash summary. They exclude media, transcripts, names, file paths, clipboard content, and raw logs. Report security vulnerabilities privately.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sent reports are public. They include app and system versions, general recording settings, recent event types, and an optional crash summary. They exclude media, transcripts, names, file paths, clipboard content, and raw logs. Report security vulnerabilities privately."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los informes enviados son públicos. Incluyen las versiones de la app y del sistema, ajustes generales de grabación, tipos de eventos recientes y un resumen opcional del fallo. Excluyen archivos multimedia, transcripciones, nombres, rutas de archivos, contenido del portapapeles y registros sin filtrar. Reporta las vulnerabilidades de seguridad de forma privada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
